---

<ServiceLayout
  lang={lang}
  title="Brand identity | SEZMOO"
  description="Identity is not just a logo – it is a set of decisions that make a brand look the same on the website, in an ad, on an invoice and on the banner outside"
  canonical={canonical}
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
>
<div class="sd">
<section class="sd__hero shell">
  <span class="sd__kick reveal"><i></i>Services</span>
  <h1 class="sd__h1 reveal">Visual <span style="color:#ffd200">identity.</span></h1>
  <p class="sd__lead reveal" data-d="1">Identity is not just a logo – it is <b>a set of decisions</b> that make a brand look the same on the website, in an ad, on an invoice and on the banner outside the building.</p>
  <p class="sd__lead reveal" data-d="1">We design the mark, colours, typography and usage rules, then the starter material so the system enters daily work immediately.</p>
  <div class="sd__facts reveal" data-d="2">
    <div class="sd__fact"><span>Scope</span><strong>Logo · system · guidelines</strong></div>
    <div class="sd__fact"><span>Output</span><strong>Brand book</strong></div>
    <div class="sd__fact"><span>Start</span><strong>Base material</strong></div>
    <div class="sd__fact"><span>Growth</span><strong>Rollout into campaigns</strong></div>
  </div>
  <figure class="sd__reel reveal" data-d="1">
    <img src="/assets/optimized/lcp/captains-club-1-d8074b45-1920.webp" srcset="/assets/optimized/lcp/captains-club-1-d8074b45-800.webp 800w, /assets/optimized/lcp/captains-club-1-d8074b45-1280.webp 1280w, /assets/optimized/lcp/captains-club-1-d8074b45-1920.webp 1920w" sizes="100vw" width="1920" height="1280" alt="Captain's Club" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" />
    <figcaption><b>Captain's Club</b><span>Event identity / visual system</span></figcaption>
  </figure>
</section>
<div class="sd__body shell">
  <div>
    <section class="sd__blk" id="sd-zakres">
      <div class="sd__blkh reveal"><h2>What we do</h2></div>
      <details class="sd__g reveal" open><summary><h3>The mark &amp; variants</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>Logo design with working versions: horizontal, vertical, simplified, monochrome and a symbol for small sizes.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>Logo design</span><span>Logo variants</span><span>Symbol</span><span>Monochrome version</span><span>Clear space</span><span>Minimum size</span></div></div></details>
      <details class="sd__g reveal" open><summary><h3>Visual system</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>Colour, typography, grids, graphic and photographic style – the rules that hold the brand together.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>Colour palette</span><span>Typography</span><span>Grids and layouts</span><span>Photography style</span><span>Graphic elements</span><span>Iconography</span></div></div></details>
      <details class="sd__g reveal"><summary><h3>Brand book</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>A document with usage rules: what is allowed, what is not and how the brand should look in practice.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>Brand book</span><span>Brand guidelines</span><span>Usage rules</span><span>Application examples</span><span>File versions</span><span>Guide for suppliers</span></div></div></details>
      <details class="sd__g reveal"><summary><h3>Starter material</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>The first set of carriers so the new identity works from day one: stationery, social, documents and signage.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>Business cards</span><span>Letterhead</span><span>Social templates</span><span>Company deck</span><span>Signage</span><span>Sales material</span></div></div></details>
    </section>
    <section class="sd__blk" id="sd-proces">
      <div class="sd__blkh reveal"><h2>How we work</h2></div>
      <div class="sd__steps">
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Discovery</h3><p>We talk about the brand, the market and the competition.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Directions</h3><p>We show several visual routes, not one option.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>The mark</h3><p>We refine the logo and its working versions.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>System</h3><p>We set colour, typography and the rules.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Rollout</h3><p>We take the identity onto real carriers.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="sd__blk" id="sd-work">
      <div class="sd__blkh reveal"><h2>Selected work</h2></div>
      <div class="sd__work">
        <a class="sd__wi reveal" href="/en/realizacja-kapka/"><div class="sd__wm"><img src="/assets/portfolio/kapka/kapka-logo.jpg" alt="Kapka Cafe – Logo · Identity" loading="lazy" /></div><span>Logo · Identity</span><h3>Kapka Cafe ↗</h3></a>
        <a class="sd__wi reveal" href="/en/realizacja-soho-form/"><div class="sd__wm"><img src="/assets/portfolio/soho-form/soho-cover.webp" alt="Soho Form – Logo · Brand manual" loading="lazy" /></div><span>Logo · Brand manual</span><h3>Soho Form ↗</h3></a>
        <a class="sd__wi reveal" href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=grafika#pt-grid"><div class="sd__wm"><img src="/assets/portfolio/el-molo/el-molo-restauracja-projekt-logo.avif" alt="El Molo – Logo · Restaurant" loading="lazy" /></div><span>Logo · Restaurant</span><h3>El Molo ↗</h3></a>
      </div>
      <div class="sd__more reveal">
        <a class="is-lead" href="/en/portfolio-en/#pt-grid">Full portfolio ↗</a>
        <a href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=video#pt-grid">Video</a>
        <a href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=animacje#pt-grid">Animation</a>
        <a href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=eventy#pt-grid">Events</a>
        <a href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=grafika#pt-grid">Graphics</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
</div>
</ServiceLayout>
